eam jar as the focal point, with the branch and blossoms guiding the viewer’s eye inward and upward, enhancing depth and intimacy. Subtle, directional lighting from the upper left casts gentle highlights on the jar’s surface and the branch’s grain, while shadows fall softly behind, adding dimension without harshness. The overall mood is tranquil, luxurious, and soothing, with a touch of natural elegance. The image feels like a high-end product photograph captured with a professional-grade camera, yet retains a soft, organic quality that suggests it could be shot with a mid-range DSLR or even a modern smartphone in a carefully controlled, minimalist setup. The color palette is dominated by muted purples, whites, and earthy browns, creating a harmonious, calming visual experience. The flowers appear slightly out of focus in the foreground and background, emphasizing the jar’s clarity and premium design. The scene exudes a sense of purity, rejuvenation, and gentle sophistication, inviting the viewer to imagine the product’s benefits as a soothing, natural remedy for aging skin. The lighting is diffused and even, avoiding any glare or overexposure, which reinforces the product’s refined, high-quality image. The composition balances symmetry with organic imperfections—the rough bark of the branch contrasting with the smooth, polished jar—adding visual interest without disrupting the serene atmosphere. The overall impression is one of quiet luxury, natural beauty, and gentle care, perfectly aligned with the product’s branding."], "inputs": [{"name": "text", "link": 69, "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {}, "type": "ShowText|pysssss", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#335", "size": [397.32855224609375, 88], "pos": [-597.5049438476562, 3622.341064453125], "id": 58, "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfyui-custom-scripts", "ver": "f2838ed5e59de4d73cde5c98354b87a8d3200190", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "vers